Z||000004||FieroJoe||07-04-2001||10:45 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MontanaFiero:<BR><B>You can fit a<I> Full Size 15" spare in there?!?!</I>  I thought it <I>had</I> to go in the back.<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>No, I don't think that you can, but all Fiero spare tires are on a 15" rim, I do believe.  That's probably what he's referring to.  The little instruction sticker above the jack on the underside of the hood shows that you have to throw your flat tire in the back trunk.<P>edit: just remembered 84Bill posted this pic in my sunroof topic a while ago, hope it helps!<P> <IMG SRC="http://cn308598-a.wall1.pa.home.com/fiero/sunroof1/image008.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by FieroJoe (edited 07-04-2001).]||||reg||1
